      <p begin="00:14.620" end="00:21.120" ttm:agent="v1">Drink slow to feed the nose, you know he likes to get blown</p>
      <p begin="00:21.120" end="00:29.120" ttm:agent="v1">Has he got enough money to spend?</p>
      <p begin="00:30.030" end="00:36.420" ttm:agent="v1">Leave? No. He's to and fro, he doesn't like it when the girls go</p>
      <p begin="00:36.420" end="00:43.870" ttm:agent="v1">Has he got enough money to spend?</p>
      <p begin="00:43.870" end="00:46.720" ttm:agent="v1">I ain't playing with these niggas</p>
      <p begin="00:46.720" end="00:54.720" ttm:agent="v1">I ain't playing with, I ain't playing with these niggas</p>
      <p begin="01:11.530" end="01:13.530" ttm:agent="v1">Know I need my dollars</p>
      <p begin="01:13.530" end="01:15.380" ttm:agent="v1">Know a nigga need my commas</p>
      <p begin="01:15.380" end="01:16.880" ttm:agent="v1">She was down when I dropped out of college</p>
