      <p begin="01:20.140" end="01:22.490" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, she was down with the foreplay drivin'</p>
      <p begin="01:22.490" end="01:24.070" ttm:agent="v1">Jumped in the car when she hit my digits</p>
      <p begin="01:24.070" end="01:26.280" ttm:agent="v1">Don't want nothin', just to pull up at the projects</p>
      <p begin="01:26.280" end="01:27.780" ttm:agent="v1">Easy to me my nigga</p>
