      <p begin="01:54.180" end="02:02.180" ttm:agent="v1">Niggas ain't playin' with em!</p>
      <p begin="02:09.030" end="02:17.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(B.I.G. Sean Don, my aura gold)</p>
      <p begin="02:23.690" end="02:25.950" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch don't you play me, don't you try me</p>
      <p begin="02:25.950" end="02:27.960" ttm:agent="v1">I need the exact amount</p>
